Update with tools/update-picohttpparser. Do not edit these files by hand: a
local modification makes every future security update a manual merge (§48).

Note on scope. picohttpparser parses; it makes NO framing decisions. Every
rule in design §18.1 — Content-Length/Transfer-Encoding conflicts, duplicate
Content-Length, chunk-size overflow — lives in src/zu_framing.c and is tested
there. Do not assume this library rejects a smuggling attempt on our behalf.
